<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your agenda</div><h1 id="rangeTitle">The next two weeks</h1><div class="subheading" id="rangeSub">One day at a time, all in one place.</div></div><section class="monthly-topgoals" aria-label="Top three goals for this month"><div class="monthly-topgoals-heading"><strong>Top 3 goals</strong><span id="topGoalsMonth"></span></div><ol><li><span>1</span><input data-month-goal="0" maxlength="90" aria-label="Monthly goal 1" placeholder="First priority"></li><li><span>2</span><input data-month-goal="1" maxlength="90" aria-label="Monthly goal 2" placeholder="Second priority"></li><li><span>3</span><input data-month-goal="2" maxlength="90" aria-label="Monthly goal 3" placeholder="Third priority"></li></ol></section><div class="week-nav"><button class="nav-btn" id="prevWeek" aria-label="Previous week">‹</button><button class="today-link" id="todayBtn">TODAY</button><button class="nav-btn" id="nextWeek" aria-label="Next week">›</button></div></div>
<div id="agendaView"><div class="layout"><main><div class="section-strip" id="sectionStrip"></div><div class="section-setup-note" id="sectionSetupNote" hidden>Start by adding your own sections with <strong>＋ Add section</strong>. Your planner is ready for your categories.</div><section class="buddy-panel"><div class="buddy-heading"><span class="bot-spark">✦</span><div><strong>Weekly strategist & buddy</strong><small>Local helper · personalized to your agenda. Let’s sort the week out together.</small></div></div><div class="bot-chat" id="agendaBotReply">I can help you choose a next step, make a plan, or talk through a rough moment. What’s on your mind?</div><form class="bot-form" data-bot-form="agenda"><input name="message" maxlength="300" placeholder="What feels hard or needs a plan?" required><button class="btn primary">Ask</button></form></section><div class="week-grid" id="weekGrid"></div><div class="footer">Your view covers the next 14 days and adds another day as each day passes. Unfinished tasks roll forward each morning.</div></main><aside class="side"><section class="panel month-glance-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Month at a glance</h2><div class="panel-caption" id="monthGlanceTitle"></div></div><div class="month-glance-nav"><button type="button" class="mini-btn" id="sideMonthPrev" aria-label="Previous month">&lsaquo;</button><button type="button" class="mini-btn" id="sideMonthNext" aria-label="Next month">&rsaquo;</button></div></div><div id="monthGlanceList" class="month-glance-list"></div><button type="button" class="month-glance-open" id="monthGlanceOpen">Open full month</button></section>


