</aside></div><div class="below-planner-panels"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>At a glance</h2><div class="panel-caption">Your two-week rhythm</div></div></div><div class="progress-head"><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Window progress</span><span class="progress-num" id="progressLabel">0%</span></div><div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill"></div></div><div class="week-summary"><div class="stat"><strong id="openCount">0</strong><span>to do</span></div><div class="stat"><strong id="doneCount">0</strong><span>finished</span></div><div class="stat"><strong id="dueCount">0</strong><span>deadlines</span></div></div><div class="hint">A missed task moves to the next day automatically. Its deadline stays put, so you can see what’s coming.</div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Your sections</h2><div class="panel-caption">Everything has a home</div></div></div><div class="cat-legend" id="legend"></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Planning capacity</h2><div class="panel-caption">Your available focus time by weekday</div></div></div><div id="capacityGrid" class="capacity-grid"></div><div class="panel-caption capacity-help">Priority defaults by section</div><div id="priorityGrid" class="priority-grid"></div><div class="capacity-foot"><label>Focus block <select id="blockMinutes"><option value="15">15 min</option><option value="25">25 min</option><option value="30">30 min</option><option value="45">45 min</option><option value="60">60 min</option></select></label><button class="mini-btn" id="planGoalsBtn">Plan unscheduled goal steps</button></div></section></div></div>
