ut an appointment at 3pm Thursday"></textarea><div class="brain-actions"><span>We’ll suggest a section, date, time, estimate, and priority. You’ll confirm a due date for every task.</span><button class="btn primary" id="organizeBrain">Organize my list</button></div><div id="brainPreview"></div><button class="btn primary brain-add-all" id="addBrainTasks" disabled>Add all tasks to my weekly agenda</button></div></section><section class="shopping-view" id="shoppingView"><div class="shopping-panel"><div class="eyebrow">Take it off your mind</div><div class="shopping-heading"><div><h2>Shopping list</h2><p>Add what you need, then check it off in the store.</p></div></div><form id="shoppingForm" class="shopping-form"><label>Item<input name="name" maxlength="90" placeholder="What do you need?" required></label><label>Quantity<input name="quantity" maxlength="40" placeholder="e.g. 2 or one pack"></label><label>For<select name="category"><option>Groceries</option><option>Supplies</option><option>Other</option></select></label><button class="btn primary">＋ Add item</button></form><div id="shoppingList"></div></div></section>
