<section class="trainer-view" id="trainerView"><section class="workout-card fitness-intake general-intake"><div class="workout-kicker">Any goal · any timeframe</div><h2>Build a plan for anything</h2><p>Use this for exams, leadership prep, applications, presentations, skills, or personal projects. Add your own steps, choose your dates, and Theo will map them out.</p><form id="generalTrainerForm"><div class="general-trainer-grid"><label class="general-wide">What are you working toward?<input name="goal" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Name your goal"></label><label>Section<select name="category"></select></label><label>Focus time per session<select name="minutes"><option value="25">25 minutes</option><option value="30" selected>30 minutes</option><option value="45">45 minutes</option><option value="60">1 hour</option><option value="90">1.5 hours</option></select></label><label>Plan starts<input name="start" type="date" required></label><label>Hard deadline<input name="deadline" type="date" required></label><label>Sessions each week<select name="frequency"><option value="2">2 sessions</option><option value="3" selected>3 sessions</option><option value="4">4 sessions</option><option value="5">5 sessions</option></select></label><label>Target proficiency<select name="proficiency"><option value="foundations">Foundations — understand the core ideas</option><option value="proficient" selected>Proficient — work independently</option><option value="advanced">Advanced — handle unfamiliar problems</option><option value="mastery">Mastery — teach or lead others</option></select></label><fieldset class="general-wide trainer-days"><legend>Days that usually work</legend><label><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="1" checked> Mon</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="2"> Tue</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="3" checked> Wed</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="4"> Thu</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="5" checked> Fri</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="6"> Sat</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="0"> Sun</label></fieldset><label class="general-wide">Curriculum file (optional)<div class="curriculum-drop" id="curriculumDrop"><input type="file" name="curriculumFile" id="generalCurriculum" accept=".pdf,.txt,.md,.csv,application/pdf,text/plain,text/markdown,text/csv" multiple><small>Choose or drop multiple PDFs, .txt, .md, or .csv curriculum files. PDF text is extracted in your browser; scanned PDFs need selectable text or OCR first. Multiple files are combined in Topics.</small><span id="curriculumFileName" data-filename="">No file selected</span></div></label><label class="general-wide">Topics, steps, or requirements <small>Add one per line. Examples are only starting points.</small><textarea name="steps" maxlength="10000" placeholder="ADS flight sergeant: practice inspection and reporting&#10;AP Bio: review chapters 1–4&#10;Or list the steps for any goal"></textarea></label></div><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Build my step-by-step plan</button></form></section><div class="workout-wrap general-trainer-wrap"><section class="workout-card general-plan-review"><div class="workout-kicker">Your roadmap</div><h2>Review your steps</h2><div id="generalTrainerPreview"><p class="trainer-empty-hint">Your dated steps will appear here before they’re added to your agenda.</p></div><button class="btn primary" id="addGeneralPlan" type="button" hidden>Add this plan to my weekly agenda</button></section><section class="workout-card trainer-card general-coach-card"><div class="trainer-profile"><div class="trainer-art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M50 22C39 9 43 2 50 2c9 0 12 10 5 22 14-14 23-12 25-5 2 8-8 14-26 14 21-4 27 3 23 10-4 7-15 5-26-8 10 18 5 26-3 25-9-1-10-12-2-28-13 16-24 17-28 10-4-7 3-15 22-16-20-1-27-8-23-15 4-7 15-4 25 11Z" fill="#D8B8D2" stroke="#865F82" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M50 34c-17 0-28 12-28 29 0 19 12 31 28 31s28-12 28-31c0-17-11-29-28-29Z" fill="#FFF9FC" stroke="#865F82" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M40 60v2m20-2v2m-16 12c4 5 8 5 12 0" stroke="#56364F" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M23 84c-9-4-14-2-17 4 8 3 14 2 20-2m51-2c9-4 14-2 17 4-8 3-14 2-20-2" stroke="#865F82" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="40" cy="61" r="8.5" stroke="#56364F" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="60" cy="61" r="8.5" stroke="#56364F" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M48.5 60.5c1-2 2-2 3-2s2 0 3 2" stroke="#56364F" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div><span class="trainer-label">Your trainer · local helper</span><h2>Theo</h2><p>Curious mind. Straight answers.</p></div></div><div class="trainer-message" id="generalTrainerReply">Tell me what you’re aiming for or what’s getting in the way. I’ll help you pick a realistic next move.</div><div class="trainer-prompts"><button type="button" data-general-trainer-prompt="I need help finding my first step">I need a first step</button><button type="button" data-general-trainer-prompt="I feel behind and need a realistic reset">I feel behind</button><button type="button" data-general-trainer-prompt="Help me make this goal smaller">Make this smaller</button></div><form id="generalTrainerCoach" class="trainer-form"><input name="message" maxlength="300" placeholder="Be honest—what feels hard?" required><button class="btn primary">Ask Theo</button></form><small class="trainer-note">Theo organizes your outline locally in this page.</small></section>
